        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pierre van Hooijdonk, Eddie Lennie\n- Events: 1998 FIFA World Cup, UEFA Euro 2000, UEFA Euro 2004\n- Organizations: Dutch national team\n- Places: France\n\nFacts:\n- The 1998 FIFA World Cup was held in France from 10 June to 12 July 1998.\n- Eddie Lennie refereed two matches at the 1998 FIFA World Cup in France.\n- Pierre van Hooijdonk was capped 46 times for the Dutch national team and scored 14 goals for the team.\n- Pierre van Hooijdonk played for the Netherlands at the 1998 FIFA World Cup, UEFA Euro 2000, and UEFA Euro 2004.",
